  "details": "Hi, is this avatar pedestal image change from the beta right now?\n\nIt seems the change has made the pedestal thumbnails render on top of world fog, which is a problem for the world I made.\n\nCan this be reverted, or is there a way for me to put the fog back in front of them so it affects the avatar thumbnails?\n\nMy world:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_54f30cf8-1c0c-4c8e-86ea-184caaf715c9/info\n\nThe area of my world which has fog is in the area opened on the gate by clicking on \"Voidria's Rift\".\n\nUntil recently, the avatar thumbnails were properly darkened by the world fog in that area. This suddenly broke a few weeks ago. I can tell the fog still works there because the eyes in the background are still affected by the fog - you can tell by running around.",
